<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO HANA MI</p>
    <h1>Discover the beauty<br>of the Vietnamese language.</h1>
    <p>
      Learn Vietnamese naturally through conversations,
      practical lessons and Vietnamese culture.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="#courses" class="primary-btn">Explore courses</a>
      <a href="#about" class="secondary-btn">Meet your teacher</a>
    </div>
