  <p class="eyebrow">LEARN WITH ME</p>
  <h2>Choose your learning experience</h2>

  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-number">01</span>
      <h3>Beginner Vietnamese</h3>
      <p>Learn pronunciation, tones, vocabulary and essential grammar.</p>
      <a href="#booking">Explore lessons →</a>
