    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-number">02</span>
      <h3>Everyday Conversation</h3>
      <p>Practice real-life Vietnamese for daily communication.</p>
      <a href="#booking">Explore lessons →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-number">03</span>
      <h3>Vietnamese Culture</h3>
      <p>Discover Vietnamese traditions, expressions and culture.</p>
      <a href="#booking">Explore lessons →</a>
